Plan:
When user opens home page, they will either get to just send a message, in which case a new session id will be created. If they pick something from their history then I will take that session id and get the messages and continue.

React:
When user writes something in clean chat, create new session ID and store the chats.
If user presses history 1 then get the session id and then get all the data. Then send it to 
python backend for the AI to summerize those. Then start normal chat.



